cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization in your work, please cite it as the software artifact and cite the paper it formalizes."
type: software
title: "N4Code: a machine-checked proof of the Dong-Yang classification of optimal finite-length (n,4) binary codes for binary symmetric channels"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 + mathlib formalization of the main classification theorems of Dong
  and Yang, "On Optimal Finite-Length Block Codes of Size Four for Binary
  Symmetric Channels" (IEEE Transactions on Information Theory, 2025):
  optimal (n,4) codes are equivalent to linear, Class-I, or Class-II codes.
authors:
